stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> SignedOut
  SignedOut --> Authenticated: email, username or OAuth success
  Authenticated --> Suspended: account status suspended pending review
  Suspended --> SignedOut: sign out
  Authenticated --> LanguageDecision: ordinary account
  LanguageDecision --> LanguageDecision: refresh or retry preference
  LanguageDecision --> ModelDecision: select or explicit skip
  ModelDecision --> ModelDecision: probe, prepare, poll or retry
  ModelDecision --> Compliance: backend ready or explicit non-AI
  Compliance --> Home: already complete or valid submit
  Home --> SignedOut: release runtime and sign out
  Home --> LanguageDecision: new browser session
  note right of ModelDecision
    Model preference is not readiness.
    Admission diagnostics are optional.
  end note
